# CVE-2026-47884 is reported through the transitive spring-webmvc jar.
#
# The Spring advisory requires all of these conditions: use of XsltView,
# an "/**" mapping that renders a view, and no explicit view name. This
# service exposes JSON @RestController endpoints only and has no XsltView,
# ViewResolver, or MVC view configuration. The vulnerable code path is not
# reachable in the current application architecture.
#
# Reassess and remove this exception before introducing server-rendered views,
# or when migrating to the Spring Boot 4 / Spring Framework 7 OSS line. Keep
# this exception visible so a future dependency refresh does not silently
# turn it into an unreviewed security waiver.
# exp: 2026-12-31
CVE-2026-47884
